flowchart TB
  REQ["Incoming HTTP"] --> TIER{"Route class"}

  TIER -->|Health / version / OpenAPI| ANON["Anonymous allow-list"]
  TIER -->|Marketing / registration / webhooks| UNSC["AllowUnscopedRoute<br/>no tenant claims required"]
  TIER -->|Operator /v1/*| AUTH{"Auth scheme"}

  AUTH -->|Production| JWT["Entra JWT claims<br/>tenant_id workspace_id project_id"]
  AUTH -->|Automation| KEY["API key handler + claims"]
  AUTH -->|Non-prod only| BYP["Development bypass<br/>fail-closed in prod-like"]

  JWT --> SCOPE["ScopeResolutionGuard<br/>claims or ambient job"]
  KEY --> SCOPE
  BYP --> SCOPE
  SCOPE --> POL["Authorization policies<br/>commit seed replay export authority"]
  ANON --> OK["200/JSON"]
  UNSC --> OK
  POL --> OK
